{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114164747977609216"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114164780986679331"],"id":"2114164780986679331","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":46,"impression_count":3982,"like_count":44,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":12},"text":"[Claude 博客分享] 构建 Agent 时何时把子 Agent 折进主循环：Skills 渐进披露常优于多专家编排\n\n企业里常见的「每团队一个子 Agent + 总编排」常复制组织架构，带来上下文损耗、延迟与 Frankenprompt；在 Claude Platform 上，一个主循环 + 按需加载的 https://t.co/3LNwU7lwIQ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114164780986679331"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T15:31:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114016908408480203"],"id":"2114016908408480203","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2107,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114009415544103242","type":"quoted"}],"text":"哈哈哈 想起了 Cursor 往事！\n\nClaude Code 产研两位负责人 Cat 和 Boris 加入 Cursor 后不久就又回到了 Anthropic.\n\n现在 Cursor 已经加入了 SpaceXSI，Claude 又有两位重要人物离职，那个故事还会再来一遍吗？ https://t.co/oWWXZzegOw","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114016908408480203"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113970175561408512"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T12:25:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113970197161988276"],"id":"2113970197161988276","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":4996,"like_count":57,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113635635705921655","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Claude 工程负责人：别再用 2024 年的方式用 Claude；少当传话筒，给全量数据与工具，用对抗评审，少堆角色 Agent\n\n@felixrieseberg 接受 @siliconvalleymm 访谈中表达了和他的文章相同的观点：Felix 几乎不再写代码：核心不是「造更多角色 https://t.co/n022I4B9Es https://t.co/M1HpzHZ9B9","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113970197161988276"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113925580928512001"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T09:28:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113925598443675835"],"id":"2113925598443675835","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":2214,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":6},"text":"Netflix 用本体把可观测性做成知识图谱，把四小时排障里「拼关系」的时间吃掉\n\n排障慢往往不是缺 MELT 数据，是各工具对「应用 / 服务 / 集群」说法不一致、关系只存在人脑子里；Netflix 建 Observability Ontology + RDF 知识图谱（QuipuDB），用类型约束把 LLM/模糊匹配等非确定性输出收成可 SPARQL https://t.co/Rb0QrQCbZu","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113925598443675835"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113922982376837120"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113923043936612792"],"id":"2113923043936612792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4517,"like_count":41,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113255396299128887","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Agentic SDLC 还不等于软件工厂，工程团队须自建并拥有有边界的 L4 系统\n\n来自 @QodoAI 创始人 @itamar_mar 的分享，他认为：各阶段都有 Agent ≠ 已有软件工厂；工厂的目标是有边界的 https://t.co/PxjtNiebac https://t.co/CzUP0i3VEF","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113923043936612792"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T07:14:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113891829586579946"],"id":"2113891829586579946","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3567,"like_count":10,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"最近几个 Pro 结尾的模型，是不是都不太达预期啊？\n\nDeepSeek V4 Pro、Kimi K3.1 Pro...\n\n以及胎死腹中的 Gemini 3.5 Pro...\n\n所以做 Flash 模型对大多数 AI 团队才是正路？","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113891829586579946"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T05:10:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113860633607430642"],"id":"2113860633607430642","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1562,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113548480979366102","type":"quoted"}],"text":"帮每位找工作的朋友转发！\n\n远程 Design Engineer 机会！ https://t.co/XxnYFKxgow","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113860633607430642"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113853084397158400"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T04:40:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113853130593239251"],"id":"2113853130593239251","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":2557,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113844051938054167","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Claude Code 核心成员 Thariq 宣布离开 Anthropic：先休息，再开始！\n\n@trq212 在参与 Claude Code 超过一年、目睹其规模远超预期后离开 Anthropic；表态仍认同公司使命与「race to the top」，先短暂休息，再投入下一段，并点名后续可关注的 Claude Code 账号：\n@addyosmani @lydiahallie @_catwu https://t.co/HoCGPsu8ZT https://t.co/P8yJjREmzy","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113853130593239251"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113837761090437120","3_2113838270752899072"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T03:48:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113839951557313003"],"id":"2113839951557313003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":93,"impression_count":21666,"like_count":77,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":5},"text":"听你们说我们前端已死？\n\n只要有 Codex / Claude Code，有手就能做网站？那能不能拜托你们这些 “AI Native” 的产品经理和设计师们，Vibe Frontend Coding 时，记得关注一下性能 😂\n\nPerformance 47 分、成堆的大 gif、大 png，更多问题都不用深看，简直前端性能反面典型 ... https://t.co/ElOmUw8pu5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113839951557313003"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113808214634663936"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T01:42:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113808235539189991"],"id":"2113808235539189991","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":3404,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113633105776890343","type":"quoted"}],"text":"用 Agent 养一支「自有」AI UGC 队伍：Tibo 的 9 步 + 12 提示词全流程\n\n别再按条租真人 UGC：按买家分段设计 3–4 个「有固定脸、有日常」的 AI 创作者，用 Agent 每日搜爆款 → 改写成角色口吻 → 同脸渲染 → 提前 24 小时排期；你只审队列、周更话题。产品只占视频里的一个 https://t.co/9rxBga5N7o https://t.co/xfFGz6BCRA","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113808235539189991"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113803910892941312"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T01:25:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113803928869744647"],"id":"2113803928869744647","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":2465,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113635562578178147","type":"quoted"}],"text":"复杂 Agentic Memory 并非总是必要：朴素 RAW-RAG 在长对话记忆评测上更强\n\n在 LoCoMo、LongMemEval、MEME、MemoryAgentBench 上，仅对原始对话历史做稠密检索 + 重排的 RAW-RAG，在 7 组「基准×模型」里有 6 组排名第一，比最强对比的 agentic memory 高 0.13–5.53 https://t.co/jHcn1WnjKW https://t.co/q9Mo4W38FS","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113803928869744647"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113799586519396353"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T01:07:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113799609671909827"],"id":"2113799609671909827","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":2282,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113269013694271940","type":"quoted"}],"text":"给 AI Agent 一台「远程手机开发机」：Shopify 如何用 Remote Dev 跑并行移动端\n\nShopify 为 Slack 里的 AI Agent「River」搭了 Remote Dev：远程 Mac 机群 + 挂载 Linux 上的 Android 模拟器，让 Agent 并行编译、测 iOS/Android、截图录屏甚至做 Live Preview；合并的移动端 PR 中由 River https://t.co/l1BaZBCqfd https://t.co/xmGZdUWM0S","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113799609671909827"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113798987442696192"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T01:05:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113799036004450807"],"id":"2113799036004450807","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1303,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113680701770068067","type":"quoted"}],"text":"月之暗面开源级 3T 模型升级：Kimi K3.1 Pro 强化编程、3D 与金融 Agent\n\nK3.1 Pro 是 K3 的大规模后训练版，号称目前最强的 3T 级开源权重模型（1M token 上下文）；在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 等 Agent 编程榜上接近 Claude Opus 5.5，并同步放出 2–3× 速度的 Highspeed 版，完整权重计划 2026-11-04 https://t.co/enZwMLZf3P https://t.co/20E5g1vLfP","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113799036004450807"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113655216562442240"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113655238741873012"],"id":"2113655238741873012","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":2323,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113636230885720101","type":"quoted"}],"text":"把个人 Grok Bot 工作流做成团队内部工具：Matt Palmer 讲 Team Bots\n\n来自 Grok Bot 团队 @mattyp 分享，Team Bot = 分享给团队的 Grok Bot：把你的判断、流程和工具封装成可协作的「内部工具」，别人能用，你仍能改规则；目标是打破「只会的人变成瓶颈、别人只能复制粘贴聊天记录」的局面。 https://t.co/GmJe0ilA39 https://t.co/turzvuYhv0","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113655238741873012"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113649643989151744"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T15:12:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113649678244003918"],"id":"2113649678244003918","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1358,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Claude Fable 5.1 如何把密信藏进 SVG 图画：截图后，新会话仍能解出约八成、GPT-6 Astra 反而更强？\n\nClaude Fable 5.1 被要求「画一张图，把指定句子藏进去、字面不要出现」时，会自发用视觉属性编码；另开一个新会话、只给渲染后的 PNG（没有 SVG 源码、也没有事先约定方案），同一模型仍能解出约 https://t.co/3FOvLGvcZu","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113649678244003918"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113639984314060800"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T14:33:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113640018292207934"],"id":"2113640018292207934","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1697,"like_count":12,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113424551396934134","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Coding Agent 榜单升级到 v2.0：FrontierCode 入场，Claude Opus 5.5 以 61.7 领跑\n\n@ArtificialAnlys 发布 Coding Agent Index v2.0：用 @cognition 的 FrontierCode v1.1 替换 DeepSWE，并收紧仓库问答评分。榜单评的是「模型 + harness」组合，不是裸模型；当前第一是 Claude Code + Claude Opus https://t.co/bG7yDVlUx5 https://t.co/OQMJHVTEvx","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113640018292207934"},{"article":{"title":"用 AI 时怎样“想得更大”：Anthropic 工程师给出的四个方向「快、高、深、广」和完整落地实践 "},"created_at":"2026-10-23T14:16:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113635635705921655"],"id":"2113635635705921655","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":43,"impression_count":7939,"like_count":27,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":5},"text":"https://t.co/ZXwzruyq7n","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113635635705921655"},{"created_at":"2026-10-23T13:23:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113622465352229354"],"id":"2113622465352229354","in_reply_to_user_id":"1727548535816724480","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":800,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113622461166313919","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"https://t.co/HCH9119hVl","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113622465352229354"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113622044357394432","3_2113622083603509248"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T13:23:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113622461166313919"],"id":"2113622461166313919","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":10316,"like_count":63,"quote_count":36,"reply_count":84,"retweet_count":71},"text":"这段时间自己高频用、也经常分享 Grok Bot，私信里陆续有朋友问：到底怎么订？官网上哪一档才带 Bot？\n\n先说清楚：Grok Bot 没有独立订阅，挂在 Cursor / SuperGrok / X Premium+ 等套餐里；X Subscription Premium 官方约 $30/月，路线一多就容易绕晕。\n\n开发之外的事我基本交给 Grok Bot。我在 https://t.co/0e5qCRhG4E","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113622461166313919"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113528061690028032"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T07:17:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113530198096531636"],"id":"2113530198096531636","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":11507,"like_count":96,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":1},"text":"今天的感动，来自老同事的简历推荐\n\n去年 8 月被辞退后，因为家里的、公司的很多不同原因，前后接触过一些团队，也拿到过 5-6 个 Offer，但都没能全职入职。\n\n其中有两个团队以顾问身份做过一段时间 Head of Engineering，9月份后也因为城市的原因或创始人前同事加盟的原因，陆续都结束了。\n\n9 https://t.co/FZbiyGMn9G","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113530198096531636"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113458953237786624"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:34:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113458972686713289"],"id":"2113458972686713289","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":102,"impression_count":6606,"like_count":77,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":18},"text":"Matt Pocock 给他的 301K ⭐️ Skills 仓库新增「software-factory」设计 Skill\n\n这个 Skill 不是可执行流水线，是一份用户主动调用的术语表：用统一语言设计「远程、无状态」的 agent 软件工厂，任务怎么跑、服务槽位怎么填、刹车怎么配。目标是配合课程 Software Factory Part Two 的 https://t.co/TpzdbZTIux","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113458972686713289"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113456573452529664"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:24:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113456593681756491"],"id":"2113456593681756491","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1651,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113302662104170922","type":"quoted"}],"text":"把 GLM-5.3-Flash 的训练上下文拉到 100 万 token：SkyRL 相对 Megatron 基线提升 64 倍\n\n在 B200（约 178 GiB）上，SkyRL 通过四类系统优化，把 GLM-5.3-Flash 的单序列训练长度做到 100 万 token，峰值约 144.5 GiB，约为开箱 Megatron 基线的 64 https://t.co/PUjSVac1I1 https://t.co/OiAnT5qj0r","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113456593681756491"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113452493321678848"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:08:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113452523512271165"],"id":"2113452523512271165","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1654,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113290966933389390","type":"quoted"}],"text":"各派一人深入 OpenAI 三周：METR 与 Redwood 压力测试内部 Agent「错位行为」监控系统\n\n今年夏天， @METR_Evals 与 @redwood_ai 各派一人进驻 OpenAI 三周，深度检查内部 agent（含 Codex）的错位行为监控。公开稿只给高层摘要：覆盖有缺口，也找到可绕过监控、沙箱与 Auto-review 的路径。OpenAI https://t.co/azHFHygA5d https://t.co/6ytnoS0wJT","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113452523512271165"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113447011047608320"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T01:46:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113447029695475805"],"id":"2113447029695475805","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":2019,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":3},"text":"把客户定制 Harness 收成统一 Codex：OpenAI 如何定义 FDE\n\nOpenAI 的 FDE 要填的坑是「部署差距」：模型看起来能做的事，和客户在真实约束下能稳定用起来的事之间的空档。打法是先把结果做进生产，再把定制方案收成可复用产品；若模型本身不够，就用评测把缺口交给 https://t.co/lGvrj54hvd","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113447029695475805"},{"created_at":"2026-10-23T00:56:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113434452689047598"],"id":"2113434452689047598","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2102,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"早上遛狗听到两位太极拳阿姨在讨论，某某是学士、博士！某某才是研究生？\n\n看来以后要统称「硕士」，研究生听起来更像学生？","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113434452689047598"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2114164747977609216","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113970175561408512","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113925580928512001","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113922982376837120","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113853084397158400","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113837761090437120","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113838270752899072","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113808214634663936","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113803910892941312","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113799586519396353","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113798987442696192","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113655216562442240","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113649643989151744","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113639984314060800","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113622044357394432","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113622083603509248","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113528061690028032","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113458953237786624","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113456573452529664","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113452493321678848","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2113447011047608320","type":"photo"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2114164780986679331","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g73uso9xlbf4y6mue3o3fjn588","oldest_id":"2113434452689047598","previous_token":"77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfprnlgzbvs0w0pyh54fauxqgp641","result_count":25}}